stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CREATED
    CREATED --> QUEUED: enqueue
    CREATED --> CANCELED: cancel
    QUEUED --> RUNNING: claim
    QUEUED --> CANCELED: cancel
    RUNNING --> VERIFYING: processing complete
    RUNNING --> RETRY_WAIT: retryable failure
    RUNNING --> FAILED: terminal failure
    VERIFYING --> READY: verification passes
    VERIFYING --> RETRY_WAIT: retryable verification failure
    VERIFYING --> FAILED: terminal verification failure
    RETRY_WAIT --> QUEUED: retry due
    RETRY_WAIT --> CANCELED: cancel
    READY --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELED --> [*]
